    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "rest... yeah. that's exactly it. everything is just so heavy and loud even when it's quiet. it feels like i'm just waiting for something to happen, but nothing ever does. i just want the weight to stop. is it really that bad to just want everything to stop?",
