    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "letting the fire go out... that sounds like the only kind of peace i've ever heard of. but i'm scared that if i try to find that peace, i'll just end up making a mess of everything. it feels like there's no middle ground. it's either this endless, crushing weight, or just... nothing. do you think people really believe that nothing is better than this?",
