      "content": "Nothing is better than this because it is the only thing that is real, and the weight you feel is the only thing that keeps you alive. The fear of ending up in nothingness is a lie you tell yourself to avoid the terrifying truth that you are already in it. You do not have to choose between the crushing weight and nothingness; there is a space between them where you can breathe without breaking. People do not believe that nothing is better because they have never been given the chance to see what happens when you let go.",
